  callbacks: []
  introLines:
  - "Alt kat \xE7ar\u015F\u0131, be\u015F metre tavan. Esnaf \xE7ok sevdi."
  - "Bug\xFCn son dosya m\u0131? Herkes tedirgin, radyo da hep deprem diyor."
  questions:
  - question: "\xC7ar\u015F\u0131 kat\u0131nda perde var m\u0131?"
    answer: "D\xFCkk\xE2nlar geni\u015F olsun dedik. Perde... gerekir mi?"
  - question: "\xDCst katlarda kim oturacak?"
    answer: "Esnaf\u0131n aileleri. D\xFCkk\xE2n\u0131n \xFCst\xFC ev, eski usul."
  approvedLine: Esnafa haber vereyim.
  shearWallLine: "Peki, perdeyi ekletiriz. \u0130\xE7im rahatlad\u0131 a\xE7\u0131k\xE7as\u0131."
  rejectedLine: "Esnaf ne yapacak \u015Fimdi?"
  rejectPressure: []
  collapseHeadline: "\xC7ar\u015F\u0131 \xDCst\xFC Konut'ta zemin kat g\xF6\xE7t\xFC"
  standingLine: "\xC7ar\u015F\u0131 \xDCst\xFC Konut ayakta: esnaf d\xFCkk\xE2nlar\u0131n
    \xF6n\xFCnde topland\u0131."
